        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHiramu inkosi yaseTire esezwile ukuthi uSolomoni ugcotshiwe ukuba abe yinkosi esikhundleni sikayise, wathumela inceku zakhe kuye, ngoba uHiramu wayethandana loDavida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.2.1+2CH.2.2+2CH.2.3+2CH.2.4+2CH.2.5+2CH.2.6+2CH.2.7+2CH.2.8+2CH.2.9+2CH.2.10+2CH.2.11+2CH.2.12+2CH.2.13+2CH.2.14+2CH.2.15+2CH.2.16+2CH.2.17+2CH.2.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Lan 2:1–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USolomoni wathumela ilizwi kuHiramu esithi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyazi ukuba ubaba uDavida wehluleka ukuyakhela iNkosi uNkulunkulu indlu yokukhonzela ngenxa yezimpi ayezilwa lezitha zakhe inxa zonke, iNkosi yaze yazenza zaba ngaphansi kwakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa khathesi iNkosi uNkulunkulu inginikile ukuphumula inxa zonke, kakho oyisitha sami, kakulangozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho sengizimisele ukwakhela ibizo leNkosi uNkulunkulu wami indlu njengokutsho kwayo kuDavida ubaba ukuthi: Indodana yakho engizayimisa ibuse endaweni yakho izangakhela indlu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:12–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 17:11–12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokhoke akutshele inceku zakho zingigamulele imikusu yaseLebanoni, lezinceku zami zizasizana lezakho; ngizakukuhlawula ngenceku zakho leyomali oyifunayo. Ngoba uyazi ukuthi kakukho loyedwa phakathi kwethu okwaziyo ukugamula izihlahla njengabaseSidoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uHiramu esizwa lamazwi kaSolomoni wathokoza kakhulu wathi: Kayibongwe iNkosi uNkulunkulu lamhla emnikileyo uDavida indodana ehlakaniphileyo ukuba ibuse lesisizwe esikhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHiramu wathumela ilizwi kuSolomoni esithi: Ngilizwile ilizwi olithumele kimi; ngizakwenza konke okufunayo mayelana lezigodo zemikhusu lezamaphane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inceku zami zizakuzehlisa eLebanoni, zizilethe ngasolwandle; mina ngizakuzenza iminyaba ukuba zihambe olwandle ukuya endaweni oyifunayo, ngizithukulule lapho; uzamukele wena, ongangenzela khona yikunginika ukudla kwabendlu yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uHiramu wamnika uSolomoni zonke izigodo zemikusu lezamaphane ayezifuna, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "loSolomoni wanika uHiramu amasaka amabele azinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amathathu lambili okudla kwabendlu yakhe, lamatanka angamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amathathu amafutha. USolomoni wamnika uHiramu lokhu iminyaka ngeminyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yamnika uSolomoni ukuhlakanipha njengokuthembisa kwayo kuye. Kwaba khona ukuthula phakathi kukaHiramu loSolomoni, benza isivumelwano bobabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uSolomoni yathatha izibhalwa kubo bonke abakoIsrayeli, abantu abathathwayo babezinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amathathu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabathumela eLebanoni, ngenkulungwane ezilitshumi ngenyanga belandelana, babehlala inyanga eLebanoni, bahlale inyanga ezimbili ekhaya. UAdoniramu wayengumphathi wezibhalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi uSolomoni wayelabathwali bemithwalo abazinkulungwane ezingamatshumi ayisikhombisa, lababazi bamatshe abazinkulungwane ezingamatshumi aficaminwembili ezintabeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "langaphandle kwalokho elezinduna ezizinkulungwane ezintathu lamakhulu amathathu ezaziphethe umsebenzi, zikhangele abantu abasebenzayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelizwi lenkosi bemba amatshe amakhulukazi aligugu okwakha isisekelo sendlu, bawabaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhi bakaSolomoni labakaHiramu labantu baseGehali babaza, balungisa lezigodo lamatshe okwakha indlu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
